# 🔐 Python Password Generator

## About
A Python project that generates random passwords
based on the length entered by the user.

## Features
- Custom password length
- Uppercase and lowercase letters
- Numbers
- Special characters

## Technologies Used
- Python
- Random Module
- String Module

## Concepts Learned
- Functions
- Loops
- User Input
- Conditional Statements

## How to Run
1. Open the Python file.
2. Run the program.
3. Enter the desired password length.

## Project Number
36
